* TOOL_MYGATES
* What this account may do and why: the account holder's read-only view of the gates (S.75, plan .claude/plan-fullscreen-toolkit.md sections 2.7 and 12, A2; owner, 22 Oct 2026:
* "the read-only 'what my account may do and why' page for the holder is added to tool.gates").  A USER app: it is the program the verb TOOL.GATES runs in every account's VOC (newvoc);
* SDSYS's own VOC (voc_template) runs the administrator's gate matrix, $tool_gates, under the same verb.
